The objective is to replace the current scapesuits and improve maintenances. Take advantage of the replacement of aging suits to improve working conditions for operators and maintenance operations.

The term " scapesuits " refers to the system comprised of:

The suit;
A pair of boots;
A pair of gloves;
A helmet;
The associated radio system;
An air-conditioned ventilation system to distribute breathable air within the suit;
An integrated pressure indicator system.

